        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Validator threshold changes (Fantom reducing requirements by 90%) and DAO governance staking proposals (Arbitrum) reflect ongoing tension between decentralization ideals and the operational need for concentrated security coordination.",
