        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "The line between cybersecurity and securities regulation blurred repeatedly — Uniswap delisted HEX following SEC action, while Coinbase and Franklin Templeton moved to tokenize regulated securities, creating compliance surface area that doubles as an attack vector.",
